# The repo is developed on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) and deployed to Linux.
# Without this, shell scripts and unit files reach the server with CRLF endings
# and fail in ways that read as syntax errors — `set -euo pipefail` becomes
# "pipefail\r: invalid option name", and systemd silently mis-parses directives.
* text=auto

*.sh text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
